      "text": "# celluloid Shader\nPost-processing cel-shading NPR pipeline\n`fx/celluloid.fx` · `shaders/celluloid.frag`",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "stage-edges",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -560,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "**Edge Hierarchy**\nSilhouette → Crease → Contact\n`evalLinePriority`",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "stage-tone",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -260,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "**Screentone + Hatching**\nMicro-dots · Hatch · Cross-hatch\n`evalDotTone` · `evalHatchPattern`",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "stage-noise",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -560,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "**Procedural Noise**\nPaper grain · Smudge · Dot warp\n`valueNoise` · `evalPaperGrain`",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "stage-celband",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "**Cel Band Quantization**\n4-band smoothstep: shadow→mid→light→highlight\n`EvalCelBand` · `EvalBandIndex`",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "stage-cellight",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": -40,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "**Stylized Lighting**\nSpecular · Rim · Ambient hemisphere\n`EvalStylizedSpecular` · `EvalRimMask`",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "stage-outline",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 260,
      "y": 60,
      "width": 260,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "**Outline + Atmosphere**\nLuma/chroma edge · Fog proxy\n`EvalOutline` · `ApplyAtmosphere`",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "shared-pseudonormal",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -80,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 50,
      "text": "**Shared: Pseudo-Normal from Luma Gradient** — Sobel/Scharr → `EvalPseudoNormal`",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper-ahead",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -620,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "## Roshaan 2026 — AHEAD\nAdaptive Hierarchical Edge Detection\nSilhouette / Structure / Texture layers\n**Relevant to both shaders' edge extraction**",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper-xie",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -220,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "## Xie et al. 2025 — CGF\nScreentone-Preserved Manga Retargeting\nHierarchical grid anchors · RPSM\n**Domain overlap with tone pipeline**",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper-liu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -620,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "## Liu et al. 2025 — SIVP\nPencil drawing via hybrid noise\nMulti-scale noise composition\n**Technique overlap with noise stages**",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper-lucena",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "## Lucena et al. 2025 — SIGGRAPH Asia\nEngine-Integrated Cel-Shading for UE5\nSmoothstep bands · Deferred integration\n**Direct parallel to cel band pipeline**",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "paper-chen",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "## Chen et al. 2025 — IJCV\nAdvances in 3D Neural Stylization Survey\nNeural vs. procedural NPR landscape\n**Contextual positioning**",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "gap-depth",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -620,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "**Gap**: Depth-aware edge hierarchy\n(AHEAD uses depth; both shaders have luma-only proxy)",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "gap-realtime-tone",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -280,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "**Gap**: Real-time learned screentone\n(Xie is offline neural; black-ink is procedural)",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "gap-multilight",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "**Gap**: Multi-light cel from image-space\n(Lucena needs engine access; celluloid has single light)",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "gap-temporal",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 500,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "**Gap**: Temporal coherence\nfor animated NPR with stable bands + screentone",
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
